  "description_short": "Community sailing school at the mouth of the Saugatuck River in Westport, open to the public. Half-day junior programs for ages 8-16: a learn-to-sail curriculum (Sailing 1 to 4, one or two weeks), catamaran and racing courses, and one-week kayaking, paddleboarding and catamaran adventure weeks. Swimming ability required.",
